WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
Today is the day before your procedure, and this is the most important day of

2
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.000
your prep,

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.480
so let's make it count. Starting today, you must drink clear liquids only,

4
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:13.150
which includes water, broth, plain tea, black coffee, clear juices, and plain

5
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:13.920
gelatin.

6
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.840
Stay well hydrated throughout the day, and remember, no solid foods, no alcohol

7
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:18.640
, and no dairy.

8
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:23.810
Avoid anything red, purple, blue, or orange, as these dyes can be mistaken for

9
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:24.400
blood during

10
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.780
the procedure. Begin your bowel prep exactly when your prep instruction sheet

11
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:29.440
says to.

12
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.400
Don't skip ahead or delay. If you're on a split-dose schedule, your second dose

13
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.040
will be taken

14
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:38.840
the morning of your procedure. Your instruction sheet will have the exact

15
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:39.840
timing for that.

16
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:45.030
One important note about your ride tomorrow. Rideshares and taxis are fine for

17
00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:45.600
getting you

18
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.250
to your procedure, but after your procedure, you may only use a rideshare or

19
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.440
taxi if a companion

20
00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:55.780
who is 18 or older is in the car with you. Going home alone in a rideshare or

21
00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:57.120
taxi is not permitted.

22
00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.010
Please make sure you have that arranged in advance. You're almost there. Stick

23
00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:01.440
with it.
